  "content": {
    "id": "p10-q6-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p10-q6-a",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Evaluate each of the following:",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "p10-q6-a-i",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "i",
            "prompt": "$\\sqrt{2\\times2}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$2$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{2\\times2}&=\\sqrt4\\\\\\sqrt{2\\times2}&=2\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 20
          },
          {
            "id": "p10-q6-a-ii",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "ii",
            "prompt": "$\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$2$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}&=\\sqrt{2\\times2}\\\\\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}&=2\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 20
          },
          {
            "id": "p10-q6-a-iii",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "iii",
            "prompt": "$\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$2$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}}&=\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}\\\\\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}}&=\\sqrt{2\\times2}\\\\\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}}&=2\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 28
          },
          {
            "id": "p10-q6-a-iv",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "iv",
            "prompt": "$\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$2$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}}}&=\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}}\\\\\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}}}&=\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}\\\\\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}}}&=\\sqrt{2\\times2}\\\\\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times2}}}}&=2\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 36
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p10-q6-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Make a guess as to the value of the infinite nest of roots:\n\n$$\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\sqrt{2\\times\\cdots}}}}.$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2$",
          "worked": "The guess is $2$: every finite nest in part (a) has value $2$, and adding another outer root gives $\\sqrt{2\\times2}=2$ again.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
        "id": "p10-q6-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Is there anything special about the number $2$ in this question? Does this simplification work for other values too?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "No. The same simplification works for every positive number $t$.\n\nEach finite nest reduces from the inside using $\\sqrt{t\\times t}=t$.",
          "worked": "For any positive number $t$, $\\sqrt{t\\times t}=t$. Each further layer then gives $\\sqrt{t\\times t}=t$ again. Thus replacing every $2$ by $t$ gives the same pattern, with value $t$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      }
    ]
  },
